    {
      "id": "2124594713483161763",
      "text": "Carnell Tate wisely got up and took off for the end zone, realizing he wasn't touched while down on his butt. Result: a 59-yard TD reception and a 34-23 deficit. Nice that the #Titans' offense has woken up. Might matter if the defense could get anything resembling a stop.",
