    },
    {
      "id": "2124594596193632284",
      "text": "Carnell Tate's 59-yard catch, get off the ground and run, is now the longest TD pass of Cam Ward's career, eclipsing the 50-yard last week. It is also the Titans longest play from scrimmage this year.",
